(4677, 201158, 74, 'Heplav 100 mg 30 Tablet', 0, 1, 0, 'Botol', '', 1, 'OTC1', 145000, 0, 160950, 0, 200000, 200000, 200000, 0, '<p>Lamivudine 100 mg</p>', '<ol>\n<li>Hepatitis B kronis.</li>\n<li>Diminum 1 tablet, 1 kali sehari sesudah makan.</li>\n<li>Istirahat cukup, hindari minuman beralkohol, konsumsi makanan bergizi, dan rutin menjaga kesehatan hati.</li>\n<li>Terima kasih, semoga lekas sembuh.</li>\n</ol>', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', 'active', 'product/q1SuVGEYg09NZiZ7cOw3RYmfpm1Pg4LVZbR756ZC.jpg', 'standar', NULL, 'anisa'),
(4678, 201159, 16, 'Primperan 10 mg 10 Tablet', 0, 0, 0, 'Strip', 'Box', 10, 'OTC1', 130000, 0, 13420, 0, 18000, 18000, 18000, 0, '<p>Metoclopramide HCl 10 mg</p>', '<ol>\n<li>Mual, muntah, dan gangguan lambung.</li>\n<li>Diminum 1 tablet, 3 kali sehari sebelum makan.</li>\n<li>Hindari makanan berminyak dan pedas, makan dalam porsi kecil tetapi sering, dan perbanyak minum air putih.</li>\n<li>Terima kasih, semoga lekas sembuh.</li>\n</ol>', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', 'active', 'product/Jiyj3E9HfAyVh6sWCzleOK9sJYai5xsF5u88GnUs.jpg', 'standar', NULL, 'anisa'),
(4679, 8998777144084, 51, 'Laxing 10 Kapsul', 0, 0, 0, 'Blister', 'box', 10, 'OTC1', 88700, 0, 9403, 98457, 12000, 12000, 12000, 0, '<p><span class=\"c1\">Daun Senna (100 mg)</span><span class=\"c1\">, </span><span class=\"c1\">Lidah Buaya (33 mg)</span><span class=\"c1\">, dan </span><span class=\"c1\">Biji Adas (20 mg)</span></p>', '<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin) [--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1 flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\" dir=\"auto\">\n<ol>\n<li>Sembelit atau susah buang air besar.</li>\n<li>Diminum 1–2 kapsul sebelum tidur.</li>\n<li>Perbanyak minum air putih, konsumsi makanan berserat seperti buah dan sayur, serta rutin berolahraga ringan.</li>\n<li>Terima kasih, semoga lekas sembuh. </li>\n</ol>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden text-center\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\"> </div>', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', 'active', 'product/FQEbBmUgvrHvvpyK2mJtqwE9O5inqjLaq30EaJ0t.png', 'standar', NULL, 'anis