(4887, 201259, 32, 'Gentian Violet 1% 10 ml Onemed', 0, 0, 0, 'Botol', '', 1, 'OTC1', 0, 0, 1500, 0, 5000, 5000, 5000, 0, '<p>Gentian Violet 10 mg (1%)</p>', '<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin) [--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1 flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\" dir=\"auto\">\n<ol>\n<li>Sariawan, infeksi jamur ringan pada mulut, dan infeksi ringan pada kulit.</li>\n<li>Oleskan secukupnya pada area yang terkena, 2–3 kali sehari.</li>\n<li>Jaga kebersihan mulut dan kulit, hindari makanan yang terlalu pedas atau panas bila digunakan untuk sariawan, dan perbanyak minum air putih.</li>\n<li>Terima kasih, semoga lekas sembuh. </li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden text-center\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\"> </div>', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', 'active', 'product/DtR8wqywBfyLPFNpXNZJk3l90v1C9BQ3d30FkNeb.png', 'standar', NULL, 'anisa'),
