(4929, 201283, 34, 'Erythromycin Stearate 500 mg 10 Kaplet RAMA', 0, 0, 0, 'Strip', 'Box', 10, 'OTC1', 128648, 0, 14280, 187199, 23000, 23000, 23000, 0, '<p><span class=\"c1\">Erythromycin Stearate 500 mg</span></p>', '<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin) [--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1 flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\" dir=\"auto\">\n<ol>\n<li>Infeksi bakteri seperti infeksi saluran pernapasan, infeksi kulit, jerawat, dan infeksi tenggorokan.</li>\n<li>Diminum 1 tablet, 2–4 kali sehari sebelum makan.</li>\n<li>Perbanyak istirahat, minum air putih yang cukup, dan habiskan antibiotik sesuai aturan agar infeksi sembuh dengan baik.</li>\n<li>Terima kasih, semoga lekas sembuh. </li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden text-center\"> </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\"> </div>', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', 'active', 'product/tjOzJtxnb0ExjmkTbDeg55pFcE896iDcdvnYUDro.jpg', 'standar', NULL, 'anisa'),
(4930, 201284, 11, 'Trosyd 1% Cream 10 g', 0, 0, 0, 'Tube', 'Tube', 1, 'OTC3', 72537, 0, 78906, 80516, 100000, 100000, 100000, 0, '<p>Tioconazole 10 mg (1%)</p>', '<ol>\n<li>Infeksi jamur pada kulit seperti panu, kurap, kutu air, dan kandidiasis kulit.</li>\n<li>Oleskan tipis pada area kulit yang terkena, 1–2 kali sehari.</li>\n<li>Jaga kebersihan kulit, hindari area kulit yang lembap terlalu lama, dan gunakan pakaian yang bersih serta mudah menyerap keringat.</li>\n<li>Terima kasih, semoga lekas sembuh.</li>\n</ol>', '', '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0, '', 'active', 'product/On99HsgmiD4AOHlDMvUfiuOt0Sq59VxFyFqrKlhn.jpg', 'standar', NULL, 'anisa'),
